      "value": "<p>You take on a terrifying aura that evokes a specific god, an aspect of divinity, a mystic concept, or another mighty force. For the duration, you are immune to fear effects, and you gain @UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.universal-creature-rules.Item.iX7wX2fqqXc1qnDb]{Frightful Presence} as a supernatural ability with a range of 30 feet and a Will save DC equal to the spell’s DC.</p>"
